    "alt": "Anna at the museum on a rainy Sunday in Berlin: sitting on a long green velvet bench, her sketchbook open on her knees and a pencil in her hand, she looks up at the white marble sculpture of a dog sitting on its pedestal; her folded grey coat lies beside her, her black backpack on the floor; on the dark-green walls, paintings in heavy gilded frames, each under a small lamp: snowy mountains above a lake, the portrait of an old lady in black, a still life of apples and yellow flowers, a big sailing ship in a storm and a horse; an old guard in uniform sits on a chair by the door that opens onto the next room; on the right, a young man with headphones and a backpack looks at the horse, in front of the tall window with red curtains, a radiator and a big potted plant; on the ceiling, a chandelier; on the floor, a herringbone parquet.",
    "consigne": "Anna is drawing a sculpture at the museum. Tap an object."
